OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh actor says it's a 'real
OL,4,Aprivilege' to lead Casualty 40th
OL,5,Aanniversary special
OL,6,
OL,7,FCasualty actor William Beck has said it
OL,8,Fis a privilege to lead the audience
OL,9,Fthrough the show's 40th anniversary
OL,10,Fspecial.
OL,12,FThe BBC medical drama, which is the
OL,13,Fworld's longest-running show of its
OL,14,Fkind, will celebrate the milestone in
OL,15,FSeptember with a two-part story.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
