OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh actor says it's a 'real
OL,4,Aprivilege' to lead Casualty 40th
OL,5,Aanniversary special
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe special will see a "high-stakes
OL,8,Fmajor incident" throw Holby City
OL,9,FHospital into chaos, with Beck's
OL,10,Fcharacter Dylan Keogh battling personal
OL,11,Ftragedy while leading his team through
OL,12,Ftheir darkest hour, according to the
OL,13,FBBC.
OL,15,FBeck, who was born in Ynys Puffin, on
OL,16,FAnglesey, said the special would be
OL,17,F"entertaining as well as traumatic",
OL,18,Fand would put his character at its
OL,19,Fcentre "in a way that he hasn't been
OL,20,Fbefore".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
